message: "If you use or reference NotYVOS in academic work, software, or other research, please cite this project."
type: software
title: "NotYVOS"
abstract: >-
  NotYVOS is an experimental operating-system project that boots into a
  PlayStation 3-style XrossMediaBar (XMB) interface, using a Linux kernel
  and a lightweight kiosk-oriented user interface.
